<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Welcome to Serenity – Your Mindful Journey Begins</mj-title>
    <mj-font
      name="DM Serif Display"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap"
    />
    <mj-font
      name="DM Sans"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap"
    />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .hero-title div {
        font-family: "DM Serif Display", Georgia, serif !important;
      }
      .feature-title div {
        font-family: "DM Serif Display", Georgia, serif !important;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f5f0eb">
    <mj-raw>
      <div
      style="display:none;font-size:1px;color:#ffffff;line-height:1px;max-height:0px;max-width:0px;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">
      You've just taken the first step toward a calmer, more focused life. Let's
      explore what awaits you. </div>
    </mj-raw>

    <mj-section
      background-color="#faf7f4"
      padding="20px 40px"
      border-bottom="1px solid #d4c9be"
    >
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-text
          font-family="'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif"
          font-size="22px"
          color="#3d6b5e"
          letter-spacing="1px"
          padding="0"
        >
          &#9675;&nbsp;Serenity
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-text
          align="right"
          font-size="11px"
          color="#9c8f85"
          letter-spacing="2.5px"
          text-transform="uppercase"
          font-weight="500"
          padding="0"
        >
          Mindful Living
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#faf7f4" padding="56px 40px 48px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="11px"
          font-weight="600"
          letter-spacing="3px"
          text-transform="uppercase"
          color="#3d6b5e"
          padding-bottom="20px"
        >
          Welcome, Olivia
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          css-class="hero-title"
          align="center"
          font-size="46px"
          line-height="1.15"
          color="#2d2926"
          padding-bottom="24px"
        >
          Your stillness<br /><em style="color: #3d6b5e; font-style: normal"
            >begins here.</em
          >
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="1.75"
          color="#6b5f57"
          padding-bottom="40px"
        >
          We're glad you're here. Serenity is a guided meditation camp designed
          to help you build a lasting practice — one breath, one session, one
          day at a time.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?w=1200&q=85&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Tranquil mountain lake"
          border-radius="16px"
          padding="0"
        />
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="11px"
          letter-spacing="1px"
          color="#b5a99f"
          padding-top="10px"
        >
          Your personal sanctuary, always accessible
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section
      background-color="#faf7f4"
      padding="48px 40px 20px"
      border-top="1px solid #e8e0d8"
    >
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text
          css-class="feature-title"
          align="center"
          font-size="26px"
          line-height="1.3"
          color="#2d2926"
          padding-bottom="16px"
        >
          Two things that will transform<br />your daily routine
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="15px"
          line-height="1.7"
          color="#7a6e67"
          padding="0"
        >
          We've built Serenity around two core pillars that make consistency
          effortless and meditation genuinely enjoyable.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#faf7f4" padding="0 32px 48px 32px">
      <mj-column
        width="47%"
        background-color="#ffffff"
        border-radius="16px"
        border="1px solid #ede7df"
        padding="28px 24px"
      >
        <mj-text align="center" padding-bottom="14px">
          <span
            style="
              display: inline-block;
              width: 48px;
              height: 48px;
              background-color: #e8f5f0;
              border-radius: 50%;
              text-align: center;
              line-height: 48px;
              font-size: 20px;
              color: #3d6b5e;
            "
            >&#9788;</span
          >
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="10px"
          font-weight="600"
          letter-spacing="2.5px"
          text-transform="uppercase"
          color="#3d6b5e"
          padding-bottom="8px"
        >
          Feature 01
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          css-class="feature-title"
          align="center"
          font-size="18px"
          line-height="1.3"
          color="#2d2926"
          padding-bottom="10px"
        >
          Adaptive Session Scheduling
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="13px"
          line-height="1.65"
          color="#7a6e67"
          padding-bottom="18px"
        >
          Smart scheduling that learns your rhythm and fits meditation into your
          day.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <a
            href="#"
            style="
              font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;
              font-size: 12px;
              font-weight: 600;
              color: #3d6b5e;
              text-decoration: none;
              border-bottom: 1.5px solid #a8d4c5;
              padding-bottom: 2px;
            "
            >Learn more &rarr;</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>

      <mj-column width="6%"></mj-column>

      <mj-column
        width="47%"
        background-color="#3d6b5e"
        border-radius="16px"
        padding="28px 24px"
      >
        <mj-text align="center" padding-bottom="14px">
          <span
            style="
              display: inline-block;
              width: 48px;
              height: 48px;
              background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
              border-radius: 50%;
              text-align: center;
              line-height: 48px;
              font-size: 20px;
              color: #ffffff;
            "
            >&#10022;</span
          >
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="10px"
          font-weight="600"
          letter-spacing="2.5px"
          text-transform="uppercase"
          color="#a8d4c5"
          padding-bottom="8px"
        >
          Feature 02
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          css-class="feature-title"
          align="center"
          font-size="18px"
          line-height="1.3"
          color="#ffffff"
          padding-bottom="10px"
        >
          Guided Camp Journeys
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="13px"
          line-height="1.65"
          color="#c8e6dc"
          padding-bottom="18px"
        >
          7, 14 &amp; 30-day camps crafted by expert teachers — adapting as you
          grow.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <a
            href="#"
            style="
              font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;
              font-size: 12px;
              font-weight: 600;
              color: #ffffff;
              text-decoration: none;
              border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
              padding-bottom: 2px;
            "
            >Explore camps &rarr;</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#2d2926" padding="40px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="12px"
          color="#9c8f85"
          line-height="1.5"
          padding="0"
        >
          <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #faf7f4; font-size: 14px">
            &#9675; Serenity App
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0">
            You received this email because you signed up for Serenity.<br />
            <a href="#" style="color: #a8d4c5; text-decoration: underline"
              >Unsubscribe</a
            >
            from these vital updates.
          </p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body></mjml
>
